    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The N7 Piranha trades the single heavy blast of most shotguns for a fully automatic stream of light shot. Each pull does less than a Claymore shell, but the Piranha keeps firing, and at close range it can sweep a whole doorway. Alliance special forces issue it for boarding actions.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
